UPDATE companies SET description='Crabtree Auto operates from Riverdale, Utah, just outside Ogden. The business traces its roots to the post‑World War II era when the Crabtree brothers opened a body shop in Logan, Utah, and began selling parts from their own vehicles. In 1947 the operation relocated to Riverdale, where Dahl Crabtree became sole owner and later passed the company to his sons, Miles and Colin. Today the third generation of the family directs the business, which bills itself as the oldest in the city.

The company runs a full‑service auto salvage yard, purchasing damaged vehicles ten model years old or newer and dismantling them for reusable components. Its inventory spans transmissions, engines, bumpers, fenders, lighting, glass, mirrors, dashboards, tires, wheels, grilles, hoods, trunk lids, axles, brake drums and doors. All parts are pre‑dismantled, cleaned, tested and shelved for immediate pickup or delivery.

Customers include body shops, insurance companies, fellow salvage yards and individual vehicle owners across northern Utah. The yard serves both commercial and retail buyers, offering a ready supply of recycled OEM parts for collision repair and maintenance.

Crabtree Auto distinguishes itself through membership in the Automotive Recyclers Association (ARA) and as a founding member of the United Recyclers Group (URG), adhering to URG quality standards for premium recycled parts. Its long‑standing slogan — “CLEAN – ORGANIZED – QUICK SERVICE” — reflects an emphasis on facility upkeep and fast turnaround.', certifications=ARRAY['ARA Certified Auto Recycler','United Recyclers Group (URG) member']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Vehicle purchasing (damaged, 10 years old and newer)", "Vehicle dismantling and parts recovery", "Used auto parts sales (OEM recycled)", "Parts cleaning and testing", "Inventory management and shelving", "Parts delivery"], "industries": ["Automotive salvage", "Auto parts recycling", "Collision repair (body shops)", "Insurance", "Salvage yards", "Retail automotive parts"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ARA Certified Auto Recycler and URG founding member", "Pre\u2011dismantled, cleaned, and tested parts stocked for immediate delivery", "Family\u2011owned, third\u2011generation operation with over 70 years in the industry", "Buys late\u2011model damaged vehicles (10 years old and newer) for parts recovery", "Slogan \u201cCLEAN \u2013 ORGANIZED \u2013 QUICK SERVICE\u201d underscoring facility standards"], "facts_used": ["Founded after WWII as body shop in Logan, Utah -> /about-us", "Relocated to Riverdale, Utah in 1947 -> /about-us", "Dahl Crabtree became sole owner, later passed to sons Miles and Colin -> /about-us", "Third generation now directs the business -> /about-us", "Member of Automotive Recyclers Association (ARA) -> /about-us", "Helped form United Recyclers Group (URG) -> /about-us", "Certified Auto Recycler per ARA standards -> /about-us", "Buys damaged vehicles 10 years old and newer -> /", "Sells undamaged parts to body shops, individuals, commercial clients -> /", "Parts salvaged include transmissions, engines, bumpers,