UPDATE companies SET description='Creation Technologies, headquartered in Westminster, Colorado, was founded in 1991. The company operates as a global electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider with 13 manufacturing locations across the United States, Canada, Mexico, and China, employing more than 3,000 professionals.

Its capabilities extend to engineering services, new product introduction (NPI) using a proprietary LEAP stage-gate methodology, supply chain management, and aftermarket repair and refurbishment. The company specializes in low-to-medium volume, high-complexity programs for aerospace, defense, medical, and industrial customers.

Its customer base spans aerospace and defense OEMs such as a communications and emergency response systems supplier, medical device OEMs including a dental diagnostics manufacturer, industrial OEMs producing hard disk drive tracking systems and automatic test equipment, and a transportation OEM focused on vehicle data solutions. Creation serves three core markets: Aerospace & Defense, Medical & Life Sciences, and Tech Industrial.

The company was founded on the belief that electronics manufacturing could be more than a transactional supplier relationship, a principle it summarizes as "big enough to scale, small enough to care." Creation differentiates itself through a global footprint combined with local responsiveness, ITAR-registered and FDA-registered facilities, and a continuous improvement program branded Thinking in Action® that targets improved on-time delivery, reduced inventory, and fewer field failures.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','ISO 14001:2015','AS9100D','UL','CSA','TUV','CE','FDA','FM','MET','ETL','IEC','IECEx','JPAL','IPC RoHS Compliance Certification','ITAR Registration','Canadian Controlled Goods Directorate (CGD) Registration','C-TPAT Registration','IPC-A-610','IPC-J-STD-001 Class 2 and Class 3','MIL-STD-810F','IPC/WHMA-A-620','MIL-STD Wiring','MIL-DTL-3100','NADCAP AC7120 (CCA)','NADCAP AC7120 (CABLES)','CMMC','GMP','ATEX/IEC EX','COMSEC','Controlled Goods Program']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed circuit board assembly", "Box build assembly", "Interconnect solutions (cable and wire harness)", "Sheet metal fabrication and finishing", "Conformal coating and potting", "Complex electromechanical assembly", "Custom MIL-SPEC wiring", "Engineering services (design, DFM/DFT, VAVE)", "New product introduction (LEAP methodology)", "Supply chain management (global sourcing, lean procurement, PFEP, EOL management, counterfeit prevention)", "Aftermarket services (repair, refurbishment, parts management)", "Test engineering (RF, environmental stress screening)", "Rapid prototyping (Creation Express)", "IPC RoHS compliance and environmental compliance services"], "industries": ["Aerospace & Defense", "Medical & Life Sciences", "Tech Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Low-to-medium volume, high-complexity", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["End-to-end electronics manufacturing from engineering through aftermarket services", "Global network of 13 manufacturing sites across four countries", "Specialized in low-to-medium volume, high-complexity programs for regulated industries", "ITAR registered and FDA registered facilities", "Proprietary LEAP stage-gate methodology for new product introduction"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1991 -> /about", "Headquartered in Westminster, Colorado -> db", "13 manufacturing locations in 4 countries (U.S., Canada, Mexico, China) -> /", "3,000+ dedicated professionals -> /", "Core markets: Aerospace & Defense, Medical & Life Sciences, Tech Industrial -> /about", "End-to-end capabilities: Manufacturing, Engineering Solutions, NPI, Interconnect, Supply Chain, Aftermarket Services -> /about", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, ISO 13485:2016, ISO 14001:2015, AS9100D, ITAR, FDA, NADCAP AC7120 (CCA), NADCAP AC7120 (CABLES), CMMC, IPC-A-610, IPC-J-STD-001, MIL-STD-810F, IPC/WHMA-A-620 -> /quality and /", "Specializes in low-to-medium volume, high-complexity programs -> /about", "Proprietary LEAP stage-gate methodology for NPI -> /", "Thinking in Action\u00ae continuous improvement program -> /quality", "Customer examples: Defense OEM (communications/emergency response), Medical Device OEM (dental diagnostics), Industrial OEM (HDD tracking, automatic test equipment), Transportation OEM (vehicle data solutions) -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Creation is the scaled specialty provider of advanced electronics for mid-volume aerospace & defense, med tech and industrial OEMs", "founded_year": "1991", "employee_count": "3,000+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered", "Canadian Controlled Goods Directorate (CGD) Registration", "C-TPAT Registration"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='creation-technologies' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Ferndale, Washington, Creations Foods US Inc. operates a newly built, state-of-the-art baking facility that is both SQF-certified and dedicated to gluten-free production. The plant sits in the Pacific Northwest with convenient access to shipping routes serving the United States and Canada.

The company produces a range of extruded baked goods and sandwich cookies on specialized high-volume inline ovens, achieving industrial-scale output. Its product portfolio includes cookies, crackers, cheese crisps, and granola, manufactured for its own brands — Moon Cheese, Highkey Snacks, AwYeah, and REAL COOKIES — as well as for private-label and co-manufacturing partners.

Creations Foods serves retailers and national brands, handling large orders packed in stand-up pouches. Its in-house innovation team collaborates with partners on gluten-free recipe development and commercialization, taking concepts from ideation through to full-scale production.

