UPDATE companies SET description='Cretex Medical operates from Elk River, Minnesota, as a privately owned contract manufacturer with over 100 years of ownership history under the Cretex Companies umbrella. President and CEO Jeff Wollerman leads the organization, which emphasizes long-term stability and a simplified decision-making structure.

The company provides end-to-end manufacturing and engineering services for medical devices, covering additive manufacturing, assembly, laser processing, machining, metal fabrication, molding, prototyping, secondary processing, stamping, sterile packaging, and sterilization management. Engineering support includes phased design, precision tooling built in-house, process validation, and project management. Cretex Medical reports producing more than one million device components daily and can deliver production-quality prototypes in as little as two weeks.

Its customer base spans the medical device industry, with focused expertise in minimally invasive procedures and intervention, robotics, orthopaedics and sports medicine, and neuro and cardio stimulation. Clients range from developers needing single components to those requiring complete, sterile finished devices ready for patient use.

Cretex Medical differentiates itself through private ownership that enables rapid capital investment—reportedly three times the industry average—and a single-source model that eliminates markups and streamlines billing. Robust quality systems, including ISO 13485, ISO 9001, FDA registration, and MedAccred certification, underpin its ability to manage risk and scale quickly from prototype to high-volume production.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485','FDA Registered','MedAccred (QTS)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Additive Manufacturing", "Assembly", "Laser Processing", "Machining", "Metal Fabrication", "Molding", "Prototyping", "Secondary Processing", "Stamping", "Sterile Packaging", "Sterilization Management", "Phased Design Support", "Precision Tooling", "Process Validations", "Project Management"], "industries": ["Medical Device Industry", "Minimally Invasive Procedures & Intervention", "Robotics", "Orthopaedics & Sports Medicine", "Neuro & Cardio Stimulation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production (over 1 million components daily)", "lead_time": "2 weeks for prototypes", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 1 million device components produced daily", "In-house precision tooling design, build, and maintenance", "Prototyping to production-quality parts in as little as 2 weeks", "Private ownership with over 100 years of stability and strong balance sheet", "Annual investment at 3x the industry average in technology and operational excellence", "End-to-end contract manufacturing from component to sterile finished device", "Single-source billing simplicity with no markups"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Elk River, Minnesota -> /", "Over 1 million device components per day -> /", "100 years of private ownership -> /", "ISO 13485 Certified, FDA Registered, MedAccred Certified (QTS), ISO 9001 Certified -> /", "In-house tool making -> /", "Prototyping in as little as 2 weeks -> /", "Therapeutic areas: Minima