UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Battery Cables LLC operates from Mesa, Arizona, where founder Vince launched the business in 2003 from a spare room in his home. The venture traces back to the late 1970s when Vince, then a student in a diesel and heavy equipment program at Maricopa Technical Community College, could not find quality battery cables for his 1948 Willy’s CJ-2A and began building his own. He later made cables for heavy construction equipment while working as a mechanic for firms such as Mountain Bell and Sunstate Equipment, then spent 29 years at Intel in electronics engineering roles before turning the side project into a full-time operation.

The company hand-builds made-to-order battery cables for cars, trucks, boats, RVs, golf carts, solar installations, and heavy equipment.

Customers span automotive, marine, solar, and heavy-equipment sectors, from classic-car restorers and high-output engine builders to snowplow operators and RV owners. The shop also serves bulk buyers through a dedicated bulk-order channel, supplying cables for fleet maintenance, construction equipment, and industrial applications.

Vince started the business because store-bought cables consistently fell short on durability; his original cables lasted 20 years without corrosion or overheating. The company emphasizes that it uses higher-grade wire than typical OEM or auto-parts-store offerings, avoids cost-cutting on materials, and builds each cable to withstand extreme temperatures and demanding starting conditions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom battery cable manufacturing", "Hand assembly and crimping", "Cable cutting to custom length", "Terminal and lug attachment", "Heat-shrink application", "Custom cable kit assembly for specific vehicle models", "Alternator cable manufacturing", "Bulk order fulfillment"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Marine", "Solar", "Heavy equipment", "Construction equipment", "Recreational vehicles (RVs)", "Golf carts", "Classic car restoration", "High-performance automotive", "Snowplow equipment"], "materials": ["SAE SGT cable", "SAE SGX cable", "Marine-grade cable"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hand-built in the USA using SAE SGT, SGX, or marine-grade cable", "Custom-made to exact length for each order", "Higher-grade wire than standard OEM or auto-parts-store cables", "No cost-cutting on materials or construction", "Designed for extreme temperatures and heavy-duty starting conditions"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Mesa, Arizona -> db", "Founded in 2003 -> /about-us", "Founder Vince started building cables in late 1970s for his 1948 Willy''s CJ-2A -> /about-us", "Vince worked as mechanic 1979-1985 for Mountain Bell, Naumann-Clark, Sunstate Equipment -> /about-us", "Vince worked at Intel for 29 years in electronics engineering -> /about-us", "Launched Custom Battery Cables in 2003 from spare room -> /about-us", "Hand-builds made-to-order battery cables for cars, trucks, boats, RVs, golf carts, solar systems -> /about-us and /", "Uses SAE SGT, SGX, or marine-grade cable -> /a