UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Foods, Inc. is headquartered in De Soto, Kansas, just outside Kansas City. The company was founded in 1997 by entrepreneur Joe Bisogno, who also founded the Goodcents restaurant brand. What began as a focused bread dough operation has grown into a diversified frozen dough manufacturer serving customers across North America and abroad.

The company operates a 71,000-square-foot automated production campus that includes a 50,000-square-foot main production facility and a 21,000-square-foot adjacent ingredient warehouse. Its capabilities cover high-volume frozen dough manufacturing — pizza dough, breads, dinner rolls, tortillas, pita, naan, cookies, and cookie cakes — along with custom formulation, co-packing, and private label production. The facility features blast freezing capacity of 22,500 pounds per hour, dough dividing from 1.25 to 40 ounces, dual 1,400-pound horizontal roller-bar mixers for pizza dough, and a bread dough dual-line fed by two 1,600-pound mixers producing 1,100 dinner rolls per minute. An in-house R&D lab and test kitchen support product development.

Custom Foods serves pizza chains, grocery stores, restaurants, schools, hospitals, convenience stores, foodservice distributors, and retail partners. Its customer base ranges from regional operators to national brands, including foodservice operators, restaurant chains, retailers, and institutional customers. The Founder’s Pride™ line provides ready-to-order frozen dough products for distribution and foodservice operations nationwide.

The company emphasizes its founder-owned structure as a source of flexibility and personal service. It holds SQF Level A certification, an AIB Superior rating, and Kosher certification, and operates a HACCP-based food safety system with critical control point monitoring. Its central U.S. location is cited for competitive shipping rates, and the business model is built around long-term production partnerships rather than transactional orders.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Level A Certified','AIB Superior Rated','Kosher Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Frozen dough manufacturing", "Custom formulation", "Co-packing services", "Private label manufacturing", "Ready-to-order products (Founder''s Pride brand)", "Blast freezing (22,500 lbs/hour)", "Dough dividing (1.25 oz to 40 oz)", "Pizza dough line with dual 1400 lb horizontal roller-bar mixers", "Automated dough delivery system", "Dual in-line high-speed process with check weighing and metal detection", "Bread dough dual-line with two 1600 lb horizontal roller-bar mixers (1,100 dinner rolls/minute)", "Cookie dough production (multiple formats)", "Custom packaging solutions", "Custom case labeling", "Automated bulk flour receiving, storage, and delivery (200,000 lb capacity)", "Cold storage (10,000 sq ft)", "Temperature-controlled dry storage (21,000 sq ft)", "HACCP-based food safety system", "Critical control point monitoring", "Preventive quality assurance", "Third-party audits", "Ingredient management and inventory systems"], "industries": ["Pizza chains", "Grocery stores", "Restaurants", "Schools", "Hospitals", "Convenience stores", "Foodservice distributors", "Retail partners", "Foodservice operators", "Restaurant chains", "Retailers", "Institutional customers", "Regional operators", "National brands"], "materials": ["Flour", "Food ingredients"], "equipment": ["Dual 1400 lb horizontal roller-bar mixers", "Automated dough delivery system", "Dual in-line high-speed process with check weighing and metal d