UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Metals Inc., a family-owned metal fabrication and restoration shop, has operated from Madison, Wisconsin since 1980.

The shop provides in-house design, fabrication, restoration, and installation of custom metalwork. Its portfolio spans cable rail systems, wrought iron gates, aluminum stairways, pewter and zinc surfaces, steel fireplaces, copper stove hoods, glass railings, and architectural signage.

